                                                "sense_id": "ab1e4b01-21a5-353d-8854-12a2d9986de8",
                                                "text": "The incident provoked an angry exchange between Diouf and the Celtic bench and, after the Rangers dug-out got involved, Diouf was booked and Rangers assistant manager Ally McCoist and Celtic boss Neil Lennon were given a warning by referee Murray."
                                            }
                                        ]
